#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Predstavljanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ktimer; allows you to enter several tasks and to set a timer for each of "
"them. When the timer reaches zero, the task is executed. The timers for each "
"task can be started, stopped, changed, or looped."
msgstr ""
"&ktimer; omogućuje da se zada nekoliko zadataka kojima će se dati vrijme "
"izvršavanja. Kada dođe vrijeme, zadatak se izvršava. Štoperica za svaki "
"zadatak se može zaustaviti, pokrenuti, promijeniti ili pomjeriti."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &ktimer;"
msgstr "Koristeci &ktimer;"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of &ktimer; when you start it for the first time"
msgstr "Ovidje je slika ekrana &ktimer; kada ga startate po prvi put"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "&ktimer; main window"
msgstr "&ktimer; glavni ekran"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To start, first add a task by selecting <guibutton>New</guibutton>. Then "
"type the command you wish to execute into the <guilabel>Command line:</"
"guilabel> box. You can then adjust the settings, or start the timer "
"countdown. When the time is up, the command will be run."
msgstr ""
"Za početak, prvo dodajte  zadatka odabirom <guibutton> Novi </guibutton>. "
"Zatim upišite naredbu koju želite izvršiti u <guilabel> naredbenog retka: </"
"guilabel> kutije . Nakon toga možete podesiti postavke, ili pokrenuti timera "
"odbrojavanje. Kad je vrijeme isteklo, naredba će se izvoditi."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of &ktimer; after you have told it to run &konqueror;."
msgstr ""
"Ovdije je slika ekrana  &ktimer; nako što ste zadali da se izvrši "
"&konqueror;."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "add a task"
msgstr "dodaj zadatak"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Let's use &konqueror; as an example. By default, it will start in 100 "
"seconds once the timer countdown is started."
msgstr ""
"Hajmo koristiti  &konqueror;Kao primjer. Zadano, će se startati za 100 "
"sekundi od kada se pokrene štoperica."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here it is counting down: in 56 seconds &konqueror; will be run."
msgstr "Ovdje se odbrojava: za 56 sekundi &konqueror; će se pokrenuti."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "56 seconds to go"
msgstr "56 sekundi jos"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now let's start the task. Here it has been running for a bit and is partway "
"through the countdown. In 56 seconds, &konqueror; will be started."
msgstr ""
"Sada hajmo startati zadatak. Evo bio je pokrenut  u tijeku kroz "
"odbrojavanje. U 56 sekundi, i Konqueror; će biti pokrenut."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"See that sliding bar? You can use it to quickly increase or decrease the "
"amount of time on a task."
msgstr ""
"Vidite onu traku za pomjeranje? Možete je koristit da brzo povećate ili "
"smanjite količinu vremena od zadtka."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid "Let's add a second task."
msgstr "Hajmo dodati drugi zadatak."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "start another &konqueror;, you can never have too many!"
msgstr "starta drugi &konqueror;,nikada ne možete imati previše!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now two &konqueror;s are scheduled to be run. The top one will be run in 20 "
"seconds, and the bottom one is currently stopped. You can add more commands. "
"While you can never have too many &konqueror;s, you probably want to use "
"other executables. Your own shell script, perhaps."
msgstr ""
"Sada su dva &konqueror;  trebala biti pokrenuti.Onaj na vrhu će se "
"izvršavati  20 sekundi, a onaj na dnu je  trenutno zaustavljen. Možete "
"dodati više naredbi. Dok vi nikada ne možete imati previše &konqueror; a "
"vjerojatno želite koristiti druge izvršne. Vašu vlastitu skriptu, možda."

